WEBVTT

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:07.320
Hey, want to go shopping this weekend?

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:14.660
Reunion.

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:15.840
Greetings.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.620
Good afternoon.

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:18.760
Rechallenge.

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:22.120
Don't you feel like trying a battle now?

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.710
Doubt. Are you afraid to lose?

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:32.030
Warning.

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:35.510
Even if you are, you can't run from the battles.

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:12.980
Selector / Honey and Poison

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:17.580
Listen.

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:20.370
It's almost the time limit.

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:24.400
You'll lose a coin at this rate.

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:26.120
I know that.

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:28.620
You must have a battle.

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:30.970
I know that. But if I lose—

00:02:30.970 --> 00:02:32.160
A Selector is nearby.

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:35.420
Where?

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:37.060
In front of you.

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:38.340
Found ya!

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:41.930
Hey, missy.

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:43.430
You're a Selector, right?

00:02:45.150 --> 00:02:46.100
Yes.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.570
Shou-chan! Shou-chan!

00:02:48.570 --> 00:02:50.320
She's a Selector!

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:51.850
Want to battle her?

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:56.860
Well? Why not do it? 
Or are you ignoring me again?

00:02:57.680 --> 00:02:58.570
Um...

00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:00.780
Sorry.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:03.160
Shou-chan doesn't fight battles.

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:04.930
What do you mean?

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:06.740
That's his policy.

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:08.370
But...

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:15.230
I intend to keep running and not 
fight until the time limit's up.

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:17.550
You're saying that again?

00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:21.120
Is that... even possible?

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:22.770
I intend to do it.

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:25.390
Why not go to a card shop?

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:28.450
You'll probably find more Selectors.

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:30.410
And you might learn something.

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:31.980
Bye!

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:41.760
Are you thinking you were lucky
you didn't have to battle?

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:43.610
No.

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:45.120
You're out of time.

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:48.620
I know that.

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:07.300
Again?

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:09.680
Time to eat.

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:25.060
Hey, don't you eat, Riru?

00:04:25.060 --> 00:04:25.740
No.

00:04:25.980 --> 00:04:27.250
That's too bad.

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:30.770
Meals always taste better when 
you're talking to someone.

00:04:33.350 --> 00:04:37.600
Maybe I'll go to a card shop on the 
way home from school tomorrow.

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:38.460
That's right.

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:40.980
You might find some information.

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:42.840
You really think so?

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:44.590
Yeah, that's right.

00:04:52.050 --> 00:04:53.020
What's wrong?

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:55.970
You haven't spoken for a while.

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:58.610
I'm a little scared.

00:04:58.890 --> 00:05:00.310
One piece of advice.

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:01.980
Okay... What?

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:04.570
It's not good to get scared before you act.

00:05:04.980 --> 00:05:06.320
It's the same in battles.

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:09.500
The enemy will take advantage 
of that weakness.

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:10.400
Yeah.

00:05:11.190 --> 00:05:13.540
Don't worry. If the two of us are together...

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:18.960
One, two! One, two!

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:24.340
One, two! One, two! 
One, two! One, two!

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:26.000
See? We're in perfect sync.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:27.340
Y-Yeah.

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:29.550
Okay, now let's go to that mailbox.

00:05:29.980 --> 00:05:31.430
Can we do it?

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:34.520
If the two of us are together, we'll be fine!

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:36.460
Yeah!

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:41.360
One, two! One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:48.110
It really is fine as long as we're together, huh?

00:05:48.420 --> 00:05:49.380
Right!

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:06.340
Crap, I'm out of Ener...

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:08.510
Well, Riru? Do you see any?

00:06:06.820 --> 00:06:08.510
Really? So I win?

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:11.220
Yes. The one in the far back.

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:13.120
Him?

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:14.930
Yes. He's a Selector.

00:06:19.240 --> 00:06:21.490
You're a Selector, aren't you?

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:24.900
Yes.

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:28.340
Will you have a battle with me?

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:34.850
Your column was really 
well-received this month!

00:06:34.850 --> 00:06:37.040
The survey results were good, too.

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:39.820
Excitement. That makes me happy.

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:43.210
It's because you play the games yourself.

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:44.430
Self-evident.

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:46.960
I'd think you normally would.

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:49.170
Not really, actually.

00:06:49.170 --> 00:06:52.070
A lot of people just dabble.

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:56.180
So, is there anything you've 
been really into lately?

00:06:56.730 --> 00:06:57.700
Affirmative.

00:06:57.700 --> 00:06:59.890
Perhaps I can get a column out of it.

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:02.730
Okay, I'll look forward to it.

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:07.570
Will you battle me?

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:09.070
Sudden.

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:11.570
I don't have time!

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:15.160
Don't worry.

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:19.920
Is something wrong?

00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:20.600
No!

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:22.450
Then, here we go.

00:07:23.320 --> 00:07:24.370
Open!

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:38.960
Calm down.

00:07:39.410 --> 00:07:40.130
Right.

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:46.410
I'll introduce you.

00:07:46.410 --> 00:07:49.270
My LRIG is named Aya.

00:07:49.270 --> 00:07:50.980
Nice to meet you!

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:52.510
Nice to meet you.

00:07:52.510 --> 00:07:54.270
Let's do it!

00:07:54.270 --> 00:07:56.880
Yeah, I'll start right away.

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:59.220
His LRIG is cute, isn't it?

00:08:00.150 --> 00:08:02.080
You shouldn't judge by appearances.

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:10.200
Onii-chan, I'm gonna go "boom boom"!

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:11.120
Okay.

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:13.050
Aya, grow.

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:15.090
Summon a Browcra. Turn end.

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:17.320
Riru, what do I do?

00:08:17.320 --> 00:08:19.870
Let's start with a full attack.

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:20.640
Yeah.

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:22.680
Grow! Summon Nohime!

00:08:24.160 --> 00:08:25.060
Attack!

00:08:29.580 --> 00:08:31.140
Not bad.

00:08:31.140 --> 00:08:33.320
Onii-chan, don't let your guard down.

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:35.640
Yeah, you're right, Aya.

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:41.410
Those eyes make this hard...

00:08:41.720 --> 00:08:43.880
Onii-chan!

00:08:43.880 --> 00:08:47.880
I think what you should do with that 
type is knock them off balance.

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:49.170
Okay.

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:50.910
Aya, grow.

00:08:50.910 --> 00:08:52.260
Play Comrus.

00:08:53.310 --> 00:08:57.150
Play ARTS Trip Trap and banish her Sagojo.

00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:09.350
Riru!

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:11.600
Suzuko...

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:13.700
Full-out attack.

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:15.660
Right!

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:20.240
I'm going to start right now.

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:21.660
Hasty.

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:23.210
At least introduce yourself.

00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:25.700
I told you! I don't have time!

00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:26.720
Hasty.

00:09:26.720 --> 00:09:30.090
But if you're like that, you'll lose 
your chance at victory.

00:09:30.910 --> 00:09:32.360
Introduction.

00:09:32.360 --> 00:09:34.490
My name is Mikage Hanna.

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:35.960
Mikage Hanna...

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:38.570
The teenage game writer?

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:39.600
Correct.

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:41.200
I'm impressed you know me.

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:43.310
Damn it... This is bad news.

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:46.840
I should have asked the bookmaker after all.

00:09:46.840 --> 00:09:48.060
The bookmaker?

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:50.060
I'll tell you if you win!

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:53.930
Open!

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:09.260
Riru, summon Akechi!

00:10:09.260 --> 00:10:12.820
Then cast Ark of Fighting Spirit 
to search my deck for Odanobu!

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:15.920
Aya, do it.

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:16.570
Okay!

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:17.650
Coin bet!

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:22.680
Holograph!

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:30.400
Team Aya is here!

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:33.220
Back us up, Onii-chan!

00:10:33.220 --> 00:10:35.190
Aya, you're cute.

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:37.130
You're so cute...

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:37.780
Creepy.

00:10:38.260 --> 00:10:40.240
Thank you, Onii-chan.

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:43.040
Where's our target?

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:44.490
Right! On the right!

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:50.740
Too bad! You got that wrong!

00:10:50.740 --> 00:10:51.970
Wasted your shot.

00:10:51.970 --> 00:10:53.580
What a waste!

00:10:53.580 --> 00:10:55.720
Aya, just like that.

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:01.940
Even if I lose today,

00:11:01.940 --> 00:11:03.680
I have another.

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:04.050
Huh?

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:06.720
"Huh" is the wrong answer.

00:11:07.300 --> 00:11:09.600
You don't get it at all.

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:12.010
If you lose here, you're finished.

00:11:12.010 --> 00:11:15.900
At this rate, I'll be the one who dooms her.

00:11:16.630 --> 00:11:18.080
Stop it...

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:19.700
Don't look at me like that!

00:11:20.590 --> 00:11:22.170
The hell are you doing?!

00:11:22.170 --> 00:11:23.520
Get a grip!

00:11:23.520 --> 00:11:26.450
Y-Yeah. Sorry, Aya.

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:29.660
You're not in any position to talk, are you?!

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:31.750
Come on! Let's go!

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:34.380
Right.

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:35.440
Honey Trap!

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:36.820
Fire!

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:45.550
Suzuko!

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:47.010
Coin bet!

00:11:48.980 --> 00:11:50.160
Honest!

00:11:54.050 --> 00:11:56.570
Narumi-san, which is the real Aya-san?

00:11:57.260 --> 00:12:00.360
The middle! But I'm not telling you that.

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:02.020
You idiot!

00:12:02.020 --> 00:12:03.910
Why did you tell her something so importa—

00:12:14.450 --> 00:12:16.020
I'm sorry, Aya!

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:17.120
Are you okay?

00:12:17.760 --> 00:12:18.860
Ow...

00:12:18.860 --> 00:12:21.590
I'm not okay, you moron!

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:23.410
It's all right.

00:12:23.410 --> 00:12:24.880
We can do this, Suzuko...

00:12:24.880 --> 00:12:26.070
If the two of us are together.

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:26.640
Yeah!

00:12:26.910 --> 00:12:28.430
Don't make me laugh.

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:30.520
It'll take more than cheesy dialogue to beat me!

00:12:31.960 --> 00:12:34.140
Yeah, that's right, Aya.

00:12:34.760 --> 00:12:39.550
I'll tell you how it feels to try and try and try...

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:41.360
and still be unable to win!

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:43.790
Destruct Through!

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:10.230
Riru!

00:13:16.450 --> 00:13:17.580
I'm all right.

00:13:18.140 --> 00:13:19.140
But...

00:13:19.140 --> 00:13:19.860
Just fight.

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:25.840
Riru...

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:29.800
I made her cry.

00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:31.240
What do I do?

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:38.540
No! No! No! No!

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:39.710
I can't do it, Aya!

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:41.700
I can't make her cry!

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:42.710
This again?

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:45.540
She looks like she's suffering so much...

00:13:45.540 --> 00:13:48.370
It's like ripping the wings off
a weak little baby bird!

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:50.140
I can't do it! I can't!

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:52.750
Stop slacking off, you idiot!

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:55.100
Don't look at her like she's your sister!

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:56.720
You sister-complex freak!

00:13:56.720 --> 00:13:59.270
Open your eyes and look!

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:02.960
Or are they so rotten, you can't use them?

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:04.670
Suzuko!

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:06.400
Let's go.

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:09.740
Yeah.

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:12.580
Line up three SIGNI and play an ARTS.

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:19.790
Finishing Touches on the Fire Dragon!

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:22.210
Full attack!

00:14:30.360 --> 00:14:32.550
Aya!

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:43.630
Are you okay, Onii-chan?

00:14:43.630 --> 00:14:46.670
You were remembering your 
little sister again, huh?

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:49.920
You know better than that.

00:14:49.920 --> 00:14:53.440
We decided I'd be your little sister, right?

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:54.320
Yeah.

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:55.630
Um...

00:14:56.910 --> 00:15:00.160
You really are just like her.

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:02.100
Like who?

00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:03.970
Onii-chan's little sister.

00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:04.630
I am?

00:15:05.020 --> 00:15:08.590
That's why, when he fights girls like you,

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:10.910
he gets really sad.

00:15:12.990 --> 00:15:15.930
My little sister disappeared.

00:15:25.720 --> 00:15:26.500
Damn it.

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:27.110
Use the coin!

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:32.220
Predict.

00:15:33.090 --> 00:15:34.230
Oh, dear...

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:36.100
I wonder what ability that is.

00:15:36.100 --> 00:15:41.480
Don't they know the saying "Haste makes waste"?

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:42.320
Initiate.

00:15:42.320 --> 00:15:44.060
Our turn is next.

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:49.130
My, Hanna-sama...

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:53.700
You must be feeling confident 
if you're revealing your hand.

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:54.680
Compulsory.

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:56.380
It did it on its own.

00:15:56.380 --> 00:15:57.970
I believe it's her power.

00:15:58.660 --> 00:15:59.700
Oh, my.

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:01.190
Then...

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:03.230
Maybe we're a good match.

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:05.030
Nihokokabi and Parain.

00:16:05.030 --> 00:16:07.040
Once she places that card,

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:08.690
I can use the ARTS to stop her, right?

00:16:10.440 --> 00:16:11.320
Coin bet.

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:15.070
Blind.

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:16.690
Surprising.

00:16:16.690 --> 00:16:17.750
I can't see a thing.

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:18.880
Is she defending?

00:16:18.880 --> 00:16:19.540
Attacking?

00:16:20.610 --> 00:16:22.290
You're mean, Hanna-sama.

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:25.790
She wanted to know things.

00:16:29.270 --> 00:16:30.340
What should we do?

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:32.380
Accept the attack?

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:33.550
I don't know.

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:35.090
I'll do as you wish.

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:38.390
Then I'll accept it!

00:16:39.340 --> 00:16:40.600
Understood.

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:42.010
Here we go, then.

00:16:45.150 --> 00:16:46.650
Disappeared?

00:16:47.930 --> 00:16:49.360
Wait!

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:50.780
What do you mean?

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:53.420
My little sister, Aya...

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:54.510
Huh? Aya?

00:16:54.510 --> 00:16:55.740
Freaky, right?

00:16:55.740 --> 00:16:58.070
He gave me his sister's name!

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:02.040
Several months ago, Aya was 
chosen as a Selector.

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:05.920
But I was busy with college at the time.

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:08.040
Onii-chan, do you know what a Selector is?

00:17:08.850 --> 00:17:10.160
Nope.

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:12.930
I've become a Selector.

00:17:12.930 --> 00:17:14.940
What's a Selector?

00:17:14.940 --> 00:17:15.870
So, um—

00:17:15.870 --> 00:17:18.180
Sorry, Aya. I'm in a hurry.

00:17:18.410 --> 00:17:19.700
You can tell me later.

00:17:20.150 --> 00:17:21.680
S-Sure.

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:26.320
Hey, Onii-chan...

00:17:26.320 --> 00:17:27.620
Can we talk?

00:17:27.620 --> 00:17:28.750
Sorry.

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:31.440
I have to submit my report by tomorrow.

00:17:31.920 --> 00:17:32.970
Oh.

00:17:33.670 --> 00:17:35.740
What is it? Is something wrong?

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:36.570
Yeah.

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:39.780
I lost again.

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:41.560
I'm out of coins!

00:17:41.560 --> 00:17:42.510
Coins?

00:17:42.970 --> 00:17:45.570
Can't you just win next time and get them back?

00:17:46.030 --> 00:17:47.220
Yeah.

00:17:47.220 --> 00:17:48.000
Hang in there.

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:51.460
You're right.

00:17:51.860 --> 00:17:54.420
Not only did I not really listen to her,

00:17:54.650 --> 00:17:57.130
but I could only give poorly thought-out advice.

00:17:58.400 --> 00:18:01.890
Hey, Aya, weren't you saying 
something about Selectors?

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:03.420
How did it go?

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:14.320
If I'd listened to her,

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:16.940
I wouldn't have ended up with so much regret.

00:18:16.940 --> 00:18:20.290
Oh, I guess in the end, you're only 
concerned about yourself!

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:22.870
Maybe.

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:28.540
Hanna-sama, why not put her out of her misery?

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:29.860
Understood.

00:18:29.860 --> 00:18:30.570
Here I go—

00:18:30.570 --> 00:18:31.750
Wait!

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:33.860
Wait a second.

00:18:33.860 --> 00:18:37.710
If I lose here, I'll disappear!

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:38.950
So wait!

00:18:38.950 --> 00:18:39.860
Refusal.

00:18:39.860 --> 00:18:41.550
Isn't the time limit almost up, anyway?

00:18:42.200 --> 00:18:44.940
I still have a little time left.

00:18:44.940 --> 00:18:46.240
Please...

00:18:46.240 --> 00:18:49.060
There's someone I want to 
see before I disappear.

00:18:49.340 --> 00:18:50.080
So...

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:51.060
Summon Oigona.

00:18:51.300 --> 00:18:54.060
Wait... Wait. Wait!

00:18:54.060 --> 00:18:56.230
Please... I don't want to disappear.

00:18:56.230 --> 00:18:57.600
Lose for me!

00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:57.600
Contradictory.

00:18:57.600 --> 00:18:58.650
Refused.

00:18:58.650 --> 00:19:01.200
You ask me to endanger myself for your sake?

00:19:01.830 --> 00:19:05.030
What is the benefit for me?

00:19:06.880 --> 00:19:08.060
But...

00:19:08.060 --> 00:19:11.110
But even if you lose today, 
you won't disappear!

00:19:11.110 --> 00:19:12.250
Of course not.

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:14.120
That's the rule of the battle.

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:17.440
Sickness Love.

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:32.310
Do you know what it really 
means to disappear?

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:38.510
Oh? Do you plan to atone for 
your sins by telling this girl?

00:19:38.510 --> 00:19:39.700
Shut up.

00:19:40.100 --> 00:19:43.530
What do you mean, "what it really means"?

00:19:46.550 --> 00:19:47.560
Question.

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:50.340
There's something I want to ask you.

00:19:50.340 --> 00:19:53.260
You said something about a bookmaker.

00:20:13.720 --> 00:20:18.320
Disappearing doesn't just mean 
that your memories disappear.

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:22.570
Your personality disappears, too.

00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:29.100
No... So that's what it means to disappear?

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:35.090
And then I was chosen to be a Selector, too.

00:20:35.760 --> 00:20:40.860
At first, I wanted to find a way to look for Aya.

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:43.700
But it's impossible.

00:20:44.120 --> 00:20:45.800
I have bigger problems.

00:20:46.330 --> 00:20:48.600
I underestimated this whole thing.

00:20:48.990 --> 00:20:52.000
Everyone's desperate to not disappear.

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:55.710
To avoid that, they'll hurt or entrap others.

00:20:55.710 --> 00:20:58.110
Some even try to buy wins with money.

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:01.360
You should do that, too!

00:21:02.580 --> 00:21:07.140
Lately, I've been thinking 
I want to disappear.

00:21:07.140 --> 00:21:08.480
No way!

00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:13.250
Hey, Riru...

00:21:13.740 --> 00:21:15.830
Is what he said true?

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:19.990
Did you lie to me?

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:21.960
I didn't mean to lie to you.

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:23.000
You're lying!

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:24.800
Not only do I lose my memories,

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:26.720
I cease to be myself, don't I?!

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:30.580
You didn't tell me what it meant to disappear!

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:31.890
You didn't ask me.

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:36.470
But then, when I see Chi-chan, 
I won't know who she is!

00:21:37.280 --> 00:21:39.860
That's horrible... That's too horrible.

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:45.400
Save me, Chi-chan...

00:23:26.650 --> 00:23:27.710
The bookmaker?

00:23:27.710 --> 00:23:31.410
Someone books matches between Selectors.

00:23:29.670 --> 00:23:32.500
Want to bet your worries on me?

00:23:31.410 --> 00:23:34.070
Chi-chan's a Selector?

00:23:32.500 --> 00:23:36.010
Homura Suzuko and Morikawa Chinatsu.

00:23:34.740 --> 00:23:37.030
You're Chi-chan, right?

00:23:36.030 --> 00:23:37.660
I'm glad I got to see you.

00:23:37.660 --> 00:23:41.020
Next time: Reunion / Bright Light and Chaos.

00:23:37.980 --> 00:23:41.020
Reunion / Bright Light and Chaos
